        {
            "id": "283415d5-dbcf-448d-91a8-79360c5c1ea8",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2149",
            "content": {
                "en": "I’m Page from Jinlan Temple in Yuntai. Thank you so much for saving me! May I ask your name?",
                "zh": "我是芸台<color=orange>金兰观的周书</color>，非常感谢你的搭救！可以请教你的姓名吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -580.0,
            "positionY": 260.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "165132e5-2ae5-459c-873b-0c99a4868cdb",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "481038d5-cf0b-4d90-b374-cf1fd0c406cd",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2145",
            "content": {
                "en": "Huh? Oh—an in-flight meal! Really? Thank you so much!",
                "zh": "啊？啊啊！是飞机餐！真的吗？太感谢你了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -1920.0,
            "positionY": 260.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9b994c45-1f02-4bb4-826a-5875c01a4263",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2146",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "（她吃东西的速度好快，一眨眼的功夫食物就都消失了。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -1582.666748046875,
            "positionY": 260.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "87f11e49-a1f9-4c47-a815-a1493fadb18e",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2147",
            "content": {
                "en": "Whew~ I’m alive again! I was in such a rush to catch the flight that I didn’t have time to eat. By the time I realized, I was already too hungry to think straight.",
                "zh": "呼~活过来了！之前为了赶飞机没来得及吃东西，回过神来的时候就已经饿的神志不清了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -1250.0,
            "positionY": 260.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "cfad4726-cae9-4fc3-9a6c-191502c7fc46",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2148",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah! I’m so sorry! I was so focused on eating that I completely ignored you!",
                "zh": "啊！不好意思啊！刚才只顾着吃，把你晾在一边了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -910.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 260.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "93582fc2-38ff-4c9a-b326-7102ccc080f8",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2151",
            "content": {
                "en": "(She looks much better now. I should be able to ask her a few questions.)",
                "zh": "（她现在看起来好多了，我应该可以向她打听一点消息。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 122.66666412353516,
            "positionY": 260.0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
                    "textId": "ch1_2152",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "What is this Jinlan Temple you mentioned?",
                        "zh": "请问，你说的金兰观是？",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [
                        {
                            "targetObjectID": "",
                            "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "variableName": "isZhouShu_Conv5",
                            "comparison": 0,
                            "compareValue": "False"
                        }
                    ],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                },
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
                    "textId": "ch1_2153",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "That’s a very unique outfit...",
                        "zh": "很有特色的穿着......",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [
                        {
                            "targetObjectID": "",
                            "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                            "variableName": "isZhouShu_Conv6",
                            "comparison": 0,
                            "compareValue": "False"
                        }
                    ],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                }
            ],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "c53927c3-c77c-4e2f-8953-f20a86ed29da",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level2-1",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "methodName": "SetGotFoodTrue",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "45847536-28d6-464f-b55d-b4f3d24c47f0",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2154",
            "content": {
                "en": "May I ask, the Jinlan Temple you mentioned earlier—is that where you work?",
                "zh": "请问刚才提到的<color=orange>金兰观</color>，是你工作的地方吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 612.0,
            "positionY": 260.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "",
                    "targetObjectName": "",
                    "targetSceneName": "",
                    "componentTypeName": "",
                    "methodName": "",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                },
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "c53927c3-c77c-4e2f-8953-f20a86ed29da",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "targetSceneName": "Level2-1",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
                    "methodName": "SetZhouShuConv5",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "db6c0c89-f486-4bc2-8308-6104ef05170c",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "481038d5-cf0b-4d90-b374-cf1fd0c406cd",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2155",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hmm~ Sort of. It's more like my home, actually. I grew up there.",
                "zh": "唔~算是吧，其实更像是我家，因为是我从小长大的地方。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 966.0,
            "positionY": 260.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f30afe15-c962-4658-b932-9515e2784a46",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2156",
            "content": {
                "en": "I see. I’m not very familiar with the local culture in Yuntai. Are there many Taoist temples like that here?",
                "zh": "原来如此，我对芸台的本地文化不太了解，这里有很多这样的道观吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1324.0,
            "positionY": 260.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6738c6bf-d300-4799-9371-963741c4029c",
            "index": 15,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2157",
            "content": {
                "en": "Not really. We’re probably the most prominent sect in the city. Jinlan Temple has apparently been around since Yuntai was first established, so it’s got quite a bit of history.",
                "zh": "那倒不是，我们应该算是市里独大的道派。而且金兰观好像在芸台建市之初就已经存在了，算是很有历史的道观了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1648.0,
            "positionY": 260.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1d82ddac-019d-493c-9114-699088c10412",
            "index": 16,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2158",
            "content": {
                "en": "That sounds impressive.",
                "zh": "听起来很了不起。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1977.333251953125,
            "positionY": 264.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "03e6fc2d-25bd-4eea-8141-62aa0ff3d1b9",
            "index": 17,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2159",
            "content": {
                "en": "Not at all~ Honestly, ever since I can remember, hardly anyone visits the temple. Shifu says it’s because of... cultural shift, or something like that…",
                "zh": "没有啦~其实从我记事起，道观就一直没多少人来。师父说这是因为什么......文化偏移，还是什么东西......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2332.0,
            "positionY": 264.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2e592453-fdf6-4c2d-ac8a-45a0bdc76fff",
            "index": 18,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2160",
            "content": {
                "en": "Anyway, hardly any young people worship the Double Stars nowadays. I guess the temple’s kind of in decline.",
                "zh": "反正现在年轻人里拜双星的人根本没几个，道观其实也算是没落了吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2674.0,
            "positionY": 264.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "cfc37033-a512-4896-aef1-d38baacbcb02",
            "index": 19,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2161",
            "content": {
                "en": "I see…",
                "zh": "这样啊...",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3022.0,
            "positionY": 264.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "46e8052f-45c2-41e6-bf40-c25bc7366d86",
            "index": 20,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_2162",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah! But don’t worry—no matter how run-down it gets, we won’t be shutting down! It’s still a historical site, after all!",
                "zh": "啊！不用担心啦，再怎么落魄也不会倒闭的，怎么着也算是历史古迹呢！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3350.0,
            "positionY": 265.3333435058594,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
